w days ago.","Evan started taking painting classes on August 16, 2023."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_5","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_5_qa_88","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What advice did Audrey give to Andrew regarding grooming Toby?","golden_answer":"Grooming slowly and gently, paying attention to sensitive areas like ears and paws. And remember to stay patient and positive throughout the grooming process.","hypothesis":"Audrey provided several pieces of advice to Andrew regarding grooming Toby. She emphasized the importance of daily brushing, regular baths, and nail trims, which are essential for maintaining Toby's health and appearance, especially for mountain life. Additionally, she advised Andrew to stay patient and positive throughout the grooming process.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Audrey suggests that Andrew should take care of Toby first. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Audrey offers tips on taking care of Toby (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Audrey advises Andrew to give a pup the love it deserves. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew will remember tips regarding grooming Toby (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Andrew is seeking advice from Audrey on creating a strong relationship with dogs. (event_time: 2023-09-24T17:53:00Z)\n  - Audrey is asked by Andrew to show the pic of the pups after grooming. (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Audrey offered help or advice to Andrew. (event_time: 2023-10