eate next. (event_time: 2023-11-13T21:15:00Z)\n  - Calvin asks Dave if he has any hobbies that give him the same satisfaction as fixing cars does for Calvin. (event_time: 2023-05-31T18:06:00Z)\n  - Dave's hard work is a subject Calvin is addressing. (event_time: 2023-10-15T09:39:00Z)\n  - Calvin encourages Dave to keep going for his passion. (event_time: 2023-10-25T20:25:00Z)\n  - Calvin is excited about Dave pursuing his passion for auto engineering and making a custom car. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave is on the journey with Calvin. (event_time: 2023-10-25T20:25:00Z)\n  - Calvin thinks doing what Dave loves for a living is the ultimate goal (event_time: 2023-10-08T15:13:00Z)\n  - Conversations with Calvin remind Dave why he loves what he does. (event_time: 2023-10-08T15:13:00Z)\n  - Dave's goal is to make Calvin happy (event_time: 2023-09-15T00:13:00Z)\n  - Calvin encourages Dave regarding his work. (event_time: 2023-10-08T15:13:00Z)\n  - Dave expressed luck and support to Calvin regarding the show. (event_time: 2023-05-16T11:50:00Z)\n  - Calvin encourages Dave to continue striving forward (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave is eager to hear all about Calvin's experiences. (event_time: 2023-08-22T11:06:00Z)\n  - Dave is performing hard work, the end result of which Calvin is excited to see. (event_time: 2023-08-14T00:35:00Z)\n  - Calvin is motivated by Dave's enthusiasm. (event_time: 2023-08-14T00:35:00Z)\n  - Calvin is on the journey with Dave. (event_time: 2023-10-25T20:25:00Z)\n  - Calvin expressed great job regarding Dave's work. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave inquired about what Calvin learned from the event. (event_time: 2023-04-20T16:15:00Z)\n  - Calvin is engaging in conversation with Dave regarding the status of his car and asking about Dave. (event_time: 2023-07-07T19:56:00Z)\n  - Calvin is looking forward to seeing what Calvin and Dave can do together. (event_time: 2023-09-22T20:57:00Z)\n  - Calvin and Dave are both