ucceed and should continue to push forward despite challenges. (April 3, 2023)\n5. **Utilize Social Media and Influencers**: She suggests using social media and working with influencers to better reach his target audience. (July 21, 2023)\n\nThese pieces of advice reflect Gina's support and encouragement for Jon as he navigates the challenges of running his dance studio.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Gina advises Jon that starting a biz is tough but suggests Jon should not let it negatively affect the studio. (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n  - Gina tells Jon that starting a business takes courage and encourages him. (event_time: 2023-03-23T19:28:00Z)\n  - Gina offers advice to Jon. (event_time: 2023-04-25T11:24:00Z)\n  - Gina offers Jon her full support regarding his business efforts. (event_time: 2023-02-04T10:43:00Z)\n  - Gina advises Jon to focus on the reason he started his business because he loves it. (event_time: 2023-04-25T11:24:00Z)\n  - Gina believes confidence is important for Jon in business. (event_time: 2023-04-25T11:24:00Z)\n  - Gina is asking for advice or tips on running a successful biz. (event_time: 2023-03-23T19:28:00Z)\n  - Jon asked Gina for advice regarding handling business challenges. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Gina advises Jon to keep learning and growing. (event_time: 2023-05-27T19:18:00Z)\n  - Gina encourages Jon to keep going and never give up. (event_time: 2023-03-23T19:28:00Z)\n  - Jon is asking Gina for tips on how to stay confident in his busine