ergy awesome.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2051,"context_chars":8439,"retrieval_duration":0.2361619472503662,"response_duration":2.5740325450897217,"total_duration":2.810194492340088,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer touches on both music and art, which are the key topics mentioned in the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to answer the question about what Calvin discussed with the cool artist he met at the gala. It explicitly states that they talked about art and the power of music connecting them, which aligns perfectly with the golden answer of 'Music and art.'","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Calvin had a really interesting chat with an artist","Calvin and the artist talked about art","Calvin and the artist talked about the power of music connecting them","Calvin and the artist connected over art","Calvin and the artist connected over music"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_5","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_5_qa_104","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"How does Audrey help out the animal shelter?","golden_answer":"By donating a portion of his profits frmo selling jwelery","hypothesis":"Audrey helps out the animal shelter by donating money or resources to support their work. This donation occurred on October 6, 2023. Additionally, she makes jewelry from recycled objects and donates a portion of the profits to the animal shelter, which is a cause close to her heart.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the