ah mentioned Anna got her a tasty vegan stir-fry (tofu, veg, ginger, soy sauce). Jolene mentioned doing yoga and meditation last Friday for me-time.\n  - certain method: Deborah uses a \"certain method\" to help Jolene figure out what is important and urgent for better organization when overloaded.\n  - hobbies: Jolene is seeking tips for balancing hobbies and studies; Deborah focuses on teaching yoga and organizing a yoga event last month.\n  - she: Deborah enjoyed when 'she' baked her pineapple birthday cakes as a child, which made her feel special. Jolene has a cherished pet referred to as 'she'.\n  - lake: Jolene is attending a meditation course at a retreat near a lake. Previously, Jolene captured a photo of a lake surrounded by trees, noting its peacefulness.\n  - video games: Jolene shared that her passion for video games started when her parents got her something related when she was 10 years old.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1983,"context_chars":7577,"retrieval_duration":0.18677663803100586,"response_duration":3.179023265838623,"total_duration":3.365799903869629,"grade":false,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer does not mention October 2023, which is the specific time frame referenced in the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"INSUFFICIENT","completeness_reasoning":"The context does not provide any specific information regarding when Jolene and Deborah agreed to go surfing. While there are several facts related to Jolene's interest in surfing and her plans, none of them indicate a specific agreement or date for going surfing together. Therefore, the critical information needed to answer the question is absent.","missing_elements":["specific date or agreement for surfing between Jolene and Deborah"],"present_elements":["Jolene intends to try surfing","Deborah encourages Jolene to pursue her dreams","Jolene is gathering information for a surfing lesson","Jolene and Deborah are partners in an activity"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_exper