ation, often attending Deborah's yoga classes with her.\n  - Deborah's dad: Deborah's dad passed away suddenly two days ago. Deborah is channeling grief by spending time with family and looking at memories, including her parents' 1993 wedding photos.\n  - last summer: Karlie and Deborah had a great time hiking last summer, which is when their last photo was taken.\n  - Deb: Deborah (Deb) ran a free community gardening class yesterday with her neighbor, which was enjoyed by people of any age.\n  - yoga retreat: Jolene attended an awesome yoga retreat described as peaceful with amazing sunrise views, making attendees feel alive and grateful. Deborah inquires about a future experience.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2055,"context_chars":8291,"retrieval_duration":0.17997384071350098,"response_duration":2.3721468448638916,"total_duration":2.5521206855773926,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer mentions 'Tree Pose,' which matches the gold answer 'tree pose,' thus it is correct.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to answer the question about which new yoga pose Deborah shared a photo of. Specifically, it states that the photo Deborah is showing depicts the Tree Pose, which directly corresponds to the golden answer. Additionally, it mentions that Deborah tried the Tree Pose after trying the Dancer Pose, confirming that it is indeed a new pose she has shared.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Tree Pose","Deborah shared a photo of the Tree Pose","Deborah tried the Tree Pose"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_7","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_7_qa_168","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"Why did Jolene get the new plant on 30 August, 2023?","golden_answer":"As a reminder to nurture herself and embrace fresh starts","hypothesis":"Jolene got the new plant on August 30, 2023, to create a good atmosphere for growth and improvement.","context":"