ct exercises"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_8","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_8_qa_21","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"How does Evan describe the woman and his feelings for her that he met in Canada?","golden_answer":"He says she's cool, incredible, like something out of a movie, and that he feels alive around her. Every moment with her is fun and energetic, also Evan feels really lucky to have someone who gets him.","hypothesis":"Evan describes the woman he met in Canada as someone he fell in love with at first sight, feeling an immediate spark that made him feel like time stopped and that their connection was so right. He expresses that being with her makes him feel alive, and he finds their moments together to be fun and energizing. Evan also reflects on the contrast between the joy he experiences with her and the health challenges he has faced, indicating that she brings a positive change to his life. Overall, he conveys a deep sense of love and appreciation for her.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Evan was in love with the woman from Canada at first sight. (event_time: 2023-12-26T16:25:00Z)\n  - Sam finds Evan's description (of meeting the Canadian woman and how it makes him feel) to be amazing, powerful, yet simple. (event_time: 2023-08-07T19:52:00Z)\n  - Evan met a Canadian woman during his trip to Canada. (event_time: 2023-07-31T00:00:00Z)\n  - Being with the Canadian woman makes Evan feel alive. (event_time: 2023-08-07T19:52:00Z)\n  - The wo