ing the gym and taking his car for a spin.\n  - Sam: Sam is sticking with a tough change to live healthier and was asked by Evan about starting painting classes years ago and why they joined now when they are already good at drawing.\n  - rewards: Sam expects to see the rewards of regular gym exercise and activity starting tomorrow.\n  - Sam: Sam is trying to keep up with a new health routine despite feeling pressured, and is planning a hike with Evan.\n  - Sam: Sam greeted Evan, mentioned starting to eat healthier, and expressed sympathy regarding Evan's knee injury, asking about ways to stay active during healing.\n  - Sam: Sam is sticking with a difficult change aimed at living healthier, as discussed with Evan. Sam previously made a yummy grilled dish and is taking a cooking class.\n  - Sam: Sam is trying to keep up with a new health routine, feeling pressured by family, but has a good support system including Evan.\n  - tool: Sam inquired about a tool, noting it sounds like a good way to stay on track and asking how it has been working out.\n  - Sam: Sam is conversing with Evan regarding an incident that happened last night involving Evan drinking too much and someone's roses. Sam later advised Evan to focus on a balanced diet and low-impact exercises.\n  - workout routine: Evan advised Sam to start with good form and technique, find a trainer to avoid injuries, start small, increase intensity gradually, and stay consistent with the workout routine.\n  - Sam: Sam congratulated Evan, enjoys running in the mornings to clear their head, and is dealing with movement-limiting discomfort while trying dietary changes.\n  - Sam: Sam is an assistant who is dealing with health issues and is being supported by Evan. Sam is still consuming soda and candy and had a dream about soaring over skyscrapers.\n  - gym membership card: Evan showed Sam his gym membership card as a reminder of his commitment to health, which includes exercise, diet, and lifestyle changes.\n  - Sam: Sam became a Weight Watchers coach, viewing it as a significant accomplishment in the quest for better health.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with discomfort that limits movement and is attempting dietary changes. Sam also became a Weight Watchers coach for better health.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with discomfort limiting movement and is attempting dietary changes. Sam previously expressed excitement about being a coach and plans to hike with Evan.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with discomfort limiting movement and is trying to make dietary changes. Sam also commented on a spot looking gorgeous, suggesting a peaceful, stunning childhood location.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with discomfort that limits movement and is trying to make diet changes to address it.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with health issues, feeling weighed down, and trying to stay positive. Sam thanked Evan for their support.\n  - Sam: Sam greeted Evan, mentioned starting to eat healthier, and inquired about Evan's new hobbies. Sam also expressed sympathy about Evan's knee injury.\n  - Sam: Sam is dealing with rough health issues, feeling weighed down but trying to stay positive. Sam discussed health and rose bush news with Evan.\n  - Sam: Sam is trying to make healthier choices, which is a struggle, despite occasional cravings for sugary drinks and snacks. Sam asked Evan about new hobbies.\n  - Sam: Sam organized an epic hiking trip last Friday and commented on food looking healthy, suitable for post-hike or accident recovery.\n  - Sam: Sam took friends on a hiking trip last Friday and is interested in healthy snacks, while also expressing concern for Evan after an accident.\n  - Sam: Sam is having health issues, feeling weighed down, but is trying to stay positive. Sam asked Evan how his partner took the news about the rose bushes.\n  - Sam: Sam is aware of Evan's marriage news and offered support. Sam's doctor stated their weight is a serious health risk, prompting plans to eat healthier despite sugary cravings.\n  - Sam: Sam is struggling to make healthier choices due to cravings for sugary drinks and snacks, and is considering starting a calming hobby like painting.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2020,"context_chars":8089,"retrieval_duration":0.3595700263977051,"response_duration":2.1165692806243896,"total_duration":2.4761393070220947,"grade":false,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer states that Sam started working out on August 21, 2023, which does not match the gold answer of July 28, 2023.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides the exact date when Sam started working out at the gym, which is July 28, 2023. This date is explicitly mentioned in the context as the time Sam planned to start exercising regularly and going to the gym. Therefore, all necessary information to answer the question is present.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Sam started working out at the gym on July 28, 2023."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_4","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_4_qa_154","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"How did John feel about the atmosphere during the big game against the rival team?","golden_answer":"electric and intense","hypothesis":"John felt that the atmosphere during the big game against the rival team was electric. He described it as a great feeling, highlighting the intensity and excitement of the event. This game took place on December 8, 2023.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - John felt everyone was hyped