 John achieved a career-high in assists last Friday during a game against the rival. (event_time: 2023-12-08T00:00:00Z)\n  - John states that he and his group won against another team. (event_time: 2023-12-10T00:00:00Z)\n  - The energy in a stadium is related to the excitement during a game. (event_time: 2023-08-11T13:08:00Z)\n  - John experiences a strong bond when surrounded by teammates who are equally passionate. (event_time: 2023-07-16T16:21:00Z)\n  - John participated in a basketball game last year where his team was trailing significantly in the 4th quarter. (event_time: 2022-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - John's team won the game by a tight score last week. (event_time: 2023-08-02T00:00:00Z)\n  - John considers his team to be like a family away from home. (event_time: 2023-08-09T10:29:00Z)\n  - John is having fun with his new team. (event_time: 2023-05-21T19:48:00Z)\n  - John's teammates made him feel welcome upon his return. (event_time: 2023-08-15T00:00:00Z)\n  - John is excited for the upcoming season. (event_time: 2023-05-21T19:48:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - John: John had a career-high in assists last Friday during a game against a rival, which he described as a great feeling with an electric atmosphere.\n  - rival: John had a career-high in assists last Friday during a big game against their rival. The atmosphere in the arena was electric, adding intensity to the memorable night.\n  - arena: The atmosphere in the arena was electric during John's career-high assist game against rivals last Friday.\n  - The team: John met back up with The team on the 15th after his trip; the atmosphere was electric, and he felt very welcome.\n  - John: John achieved a career-high in assists last Friday during a big game against a rival. He previously won a game against a top team and mentors younger players.\n  - life: John shared a career-high in assists last Friday during a game against a rival. He views his passion as significant, allowing him to be himself and chase dreams.\n  - game: John reported a game was a total success, drawing a large crowd and raising money for charity. This follows a previous close basketball game that John won.\n  - career-high in assists last Friday in our big game against our rival: John achieved a career-high in assists last Friday during a big game against a rival.\n  - John: John congratulated Tim and mentioned achieving a career-high in assists during a game against a rival last Friday.\n  - John: John won a tough basketball game, highlighting the camaraderie and hard work with his team. He recently ate a frog treat and enjoyed the win.\n  - John's teammates: John's teammates welcomed him back after his trip with an electric atmosphere; they also signed something for a special reason.\n  - another team: John's basketball team had a close game against 'another team' last week, which they won at the final buzzer.\n  - assists: John achieved a career-high in assists last Friday during a big game against a rival.\n  - those plays: John achieved a career-high in assists last Friday during a game against a rival, prompting Tim to ask how it felt making \"those plays\".\n  - team: John's team recently won an intense basketball game. John previously missed games due to injury, preventing him from assisting the team.\n  - games: Tim enjoys playing board games with friends and family during free time, when he is not reading or on road trips. John had a career-high in assists last Friday in a game against a rival.\n  - that game: John scored 40 points in 'that game' last week, achieving his highest score and leading his team to a tough win. Tim mentioned an inspirational Finals game with an epic block that changed the game.\n  - John: John ate a frog treat, played a tough but won a basketball game with his team, and is reading \"Dune\" by Frank Herbert.\n  - John: John congratulated Tim on getting into a study abroad program in Galway, Ireland. John also reported success in a game event that raised money for charity.\n  - John: John is teammates with Tim, played on a sports team for four years in high school, loves discovering new cities, and shared a picture from a trip to New York City.\n  - John: John found a new gym and is training to stay fit for his professional basketball game, adapting his routine for balance. He also discussed film memories with Tim.\n  - John: John offered advice to Tim on handling setbacks by reflecting and improving, similar to challenges on the court. John also discussed the impact books can have on shifting thoughts.\n  - film: Tim shared watching the film \"Elf\" during the holidays, which makes him laugh and feel festive. John mentioned being a total movie fan who enjoys seeing films come alive on the big screen as relaxation.\n  - John: John has been playing professionally for just under a year and confirmed that being a pro basketball player is quite a journey.\n  - John: John has been playing professionally for almost a year and attended a Harry Potter trivia charity event last August.\n  - John: John chatted with Tim, discussed how struggles make achievements rewarding, and recently enjoyed a road trip with his wife on the European coastline.\n  - John: John attended a local restaurant with new teammates last week to get to know them better.\n  - John: John chatted with Tim about his team's season and his interest in historical architecture and visiting castles. John is excited to explore the world.\n  - John: John found a new gym to maintain his basketball game fitness. He successfully adapted and tweaked his training routine to find the right balance. He also values family time.\n  - new team: John signed with a new team and is excited for the season. Tim asked John how things are going with the new team.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2081,"context_chars":8300,"retrieval_duration":0.32845211029052734,"response_duration":2.1584272384643555,"total_duration":2.4