rs with theirs, which she considers a gift.\n4. The overall future and the joy of giving love and acceptance through adoption.\n\nThese points reflect her enthusiasm and determination to move forward in her adoption journey.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Caroline is eager to begin the process of adoption. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline intends to provide a safe, loving home for kids through adoption. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline has a dream to adopt and provide a loving home. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline needs to gather documents for the adoption process. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Melanie asks Caroline if she is excited about anything regarding the adoption process. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Caroline expressed increased determination to pursue adoption after the council meeting (event_time: 2023-07-14T00:00:00Z)\n  - Caroline is ready to give all her love to a child through adoption. (event_time: 2023-08-23T15:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline suggests researching adoption agencies for the adoption process. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline sought advice regarding adoption. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline is sharing her adoption journey and helping others with theirs, which she considers a gift. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline is currently researching adoption agencies. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Caroline is asking Melanie if she has experience or knowledge abou