etime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Joanna encourages reflecting on fond memories. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20:10:00Z)\n  - Joanna will always remember moments that bring happiness. (event_time: 2022-05-25T15:00:00Z)\n  - Joanna started documenting some of her favorite memories. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20